## Design patterns

none — one converter source, no growing branch over authentication types

One row per pattern this layer adopts, decided through
`@.claude/skills/gof-design-patterns/SKILL.md` § Design-time use:
`| Force or symptom | Pattern | Classes and interfaces it creates | "When not" checked |`.

## Impact on approved use cases

| Case | Endpoint | Before | After | Decision |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| UC-002 | `GET /api/v1/orders/{orderId}` | public (no chain existed) | authenticated | protected from now on — asked in this run; the owner check for reads is `BL-07` |
| UC-002 | `OrderControllerTest` | ran with no filter chain | imports `SecurityConfig` and sends a token; a new case asserts 401 with none | listed in § 10 for `test-architect` |

## Implementation order

1. The dependencies of § 8
2. `Roles`, `ProblemDetailAuthenticationEntryPoint`, `ProblemDetailAccessDeniedHandler`, `SecurityExceptionHandler`
3. `JwtResourceServerConfig`, then `SecurityConfig`, then `MethodSecurityConfig`, `SecurityAuditListener`, `OpenApiSecurityConfig`
4. Actor resolution in `OrderController.cancel` — after the REST block wrote the controller
5. Properties in `application.yml`
6. Tests — `40-tests.md`
